From 9133efb6f5337d36817e2ee33d2c4b543d371fa5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.ai>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:05:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(backend,passes,driver): atomic16 call ABI, peephole
 liveness/LEA/flag, SROA Ptr fields, and inline SROA unlock

- src/driver/option_table.rs: classify -fno-sanitize* flags as Class::BenignNoop
  and add unit tests for -fno-sanitize=all, -fno-sanitize-recover=all, and
  -fno-sanitize-trap=undefined.
- src/backend/liveness.rs, src/backend/regalloc.rs,
  src/backend/stack_layout/analysis.rs, src/backend/x86/codegen/atomics.rs:
  treat 128-bit AtomicLoad, AtomicStore, AtomicRmw, and AtomicCmpxchg as call
  points that clobber caller-saved registers and require stack frame alignment,
  fixing -O2 128-bit atomic miscompilations (check_atomic16_runtime.sh).
- src/backend/x86/codegen/peephole/passes/{helpers,liveness,local_patterns,relay_and_lea,flag_peepholes}.rs,
  src/backend/x86/codegen/peephole/types.rs:
  * fast byte-level dispatch in is_read_modify_write and src_mentions_family,
    and '#' pre-check in classify_line;
  * cache FunctionIndex in LazyDeadness::invalidate and use CfiIndex in
    hoist_loop_invariant_gpr_load;
  * cache per-function liveness results in FileLiveness::solve_function across
    peephole passes (expat_siphash24.c Callgrind Ir -46.1% at -O1, -27.6% at -O2);
  * allow %rbp destination in fold_copy_add_into_lea when frame pointer is
    omitted and support register masks in fold_copy_and_mask_into_test when
    destination is dead (zstd RLE ZSTD_ldm_gear_feed -25.00% Ir, total -14.02%);
  * reject self-referencing SIB index in compose_indexed_relay and
    splice_lea_into_mem_operand when consumer index shares register family with
    LEA destination.
- src/passes/aggregate_sroa/split.rs, src/passes/inline.rs:
  * allow IrType::Ptr fields in promotable_width and refuse splitting allocas
    whose address is stored as the value of an Instruction::Store;
  * unlock SROA for small multi-site struct-pointer helpers and elide readonly
    local memcpys in call-free inlined bodies (zstd L3 source -19.32% Ir).
- scripts/audit_census_baseline.json: update baseline for upstream 3eac3663c.
